<title>SPAIN: Bankinter cuts its prime rate to 6.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Bankinter cuts its prime rate to 6.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankinter said it cut its prime lending rate to 6.75 percent from 7.25 percent right after the Bank of Spain reduced its key money market rate at this morning's repo to 6.75 percent from 7.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
